📌 MANDATORY PART (Baseline - ~25% of grade)
✅ Single-page application with browser navigation (Back/Forward buttons)
✅ Compatible with latest Mozilla Firefox (and other browsers)
✅ No unhandled errors or warnings
✅ Docker deployment with single command launch
✅ TypeScript frontend (can be overridden by modules)
✅ Live multiplayer Pong game (same keyboard or remote)
✅ Tournament system with matchmaking
✅ Player registration with aliases (enhanced by Standard User Management module)
✅ Identical rules for all players (same paddle speed, including AI)
✅ Security: Password hashing, SQL injection/XSS protection, HTTPS/WSS
✅ Form validation (client-side or server-side)
✅ Credentials stored in .env (not in git)

